PQ & = \sqrt{QR^2 - PR^2} \\
&=\sqrt{15^2 - 3^2}\\
&=\sqrt{(5\cdot 3)^2 - 3^2} \\
&= \sqrt{25\cdot 3^2 - 3^2} \\
&= \sqrt{24\cdot 3^2} \\
&= \sqrt{6\cdot 4\cdot 3^2} \\
&= \boxed{6\sqrt{6}}.
\end{align*}

