s:
From our similarity, we have that: \begin{align*}
\frac{DE}{AC} &= \frac{BE}{BC} \\
DE &= \frac{BE \cdot AC}{BC}\\
&= \frac{13\text{ cm} \cdot 12\text{ cm}}{20\text{ cm}} = \boxed{7.8}\text{ cm}.
\end{align*}

